  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Central discovers, UCS Manager collects",
      "items": [
        "Central answers two questions only: which domains are registered (computeSystem) and which profiles exist (lsServer) \u2014 ADR-0014",
        "Every domain is its own login with INVENTORY_UCS_MANAGER_*; Central reports each domain's address itself",
        "Live run 2026-08-18: 152 registered domains, ~3,346 servers, every profile global-controlled \u2014 ADR-0014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What UCSPE 4.2(2aS9) proved",
      "items": [
        "A blade's own mgmtIf reports access='unspecified'; the out-of-band filter matched only fabric interconnects, so BMC selection is by DN position \u2014 ADR-0009",
        "UCSPE reports 00:00:00:00:00:00 for blade CIMC MACs; normalize_mac drops it \u2014 ADR-0009",
        "A name with no site token falls back to the profile's org DN \u2014 CLAUDE.md, name-derived sites"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Failure is contained per domain",
      "items": [
        "One unreachable or slow domain is logged and skipped; the fleet run continues",
        "Domains stream with asyncio.as_completed, so a run killed by activeDeadlineSeconds keeps what finished \u2014 ADR-0014, 2026-09-02",
        "Cancel and drain on early close so every domain still logs out \u2014 docs/cisco-collectors.md, Sessions"
      ]
    }
  ]
